{"kiki|Mummy Prathyu! I am Kiki! Can I fly with you? Please, please!": "vo_00.mp3", "kiki|Yay! So much fun, Mummy! 💖": "vo_01.mp3", "kiki|Wheee! So much fun, Mummy!": "vo_02.mp3", "kiki|Mummy Prathyu, I love our colours! So pretty!": "vo_03.mp3", "kiki|Bye bye Mummy! See you soon!": "vo_04.mp3", "kiki|Hi Mummy Prathyu!": "vo_05.mp3", "prathyu|Hello Kiki! Look, we are both mermaids now!": "vo_06.mp3", "prathyu|Hello Kiki! Stay close to Mummy!": "vo_07.mp3", "prathyu|Bye Kiki! Mummy loves you!": "vo_08.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! That is Mercury, the tiniest planet, very close to the Sun. It goes round the Sun in only eighty eight days!": "vo_09.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! This is Venus, the hottest planet, wrapped in thick yellow clouds. And it spins the wrong way round!": "vo_10.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki, that is Earth, our home! The blue is water, and the little grey friend is our Moon.": "vo_11.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! Mars is the red planet. It is rusty and dusty, and it has the tallest volcano of all!": "vo_12.mp3", "prathyu|Wow! Jupiter is the giant! It is so big that all the other planets could fit inside it. It has a great big storm too.": "vo_13.mp3", "prathyu|Beautiful! Saturn has beautiful rings made of ice and rocks. It is so light it could float in water!": "vo_14.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! Uranus is icy blue and rolls around on its side, like a ball!": "vo_15.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! Neptune is deep blue and very windy. It is the farthest planet from the Sun.": "vo_16.mp3", "prathyu|Wow, we are underwater now, Kiki! Fish, turtles and whales live in the lake. Swim through the glowing bubbles!": "vo_17.mp3", "prathyu|Back on land! Look Kiki, see the flowers and the trees? Butterflies love meadows like this.": "vo_18.mp3", "prathyu|Now we fly above the clouds and into space! Come, I will tell you about the planets as we pass them.": "vo_19.mp3", "angel|Welcome to Heaven, little unicorn! ✨": "vo_20.mp3", "angel|Goodbye, brave flyer! Come back soon 💫": "vo_21.mp3"}